Count the frames dropped because the decode unit queue overflowed (the overflowing frame and every
frame dropped until the IDR frame it requested) apart from network loss, so the performance overlay,
the stream doctor and the bitrate logic no longer read a decoder that fell behind as frame loss
(nightjar#80; LiGetDecoderDrops, the Rust engine's VideoStats::decoder_drops). Add it at the end of
the list.

